Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The End. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't find a better deal, Signore!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The other guy said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll throw in a\Npersonal tour of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a character! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My back disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? As agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, there anything\NI should know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be off, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you wanted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, this is all the\Nmoney I could scrounge together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I guess this is all you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Jewel of Southern Italy, Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a city so beautiful, a single\Nvisit can satisfy the soul unto death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so the saying goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how we can get\Nto the Church of Santa Char?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Santa Char, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to want to keep straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then at the first signal, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Church is that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for catching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for bumping into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch where you're going next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take off. Hey, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.42,0:01:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, you're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, talk about Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.26,0:01:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweep you off your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have snuck a pig with that Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they just fly out of my bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they landed there and flew off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in Napoli, vigilance\Nis a prized virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I'll take a\Nchocolate and pistachio, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it two. Va Bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No license, no work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a move on, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut, so. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You only moved one time down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can bypass that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in a cheaper way downtown. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.35,0:02:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you call cheap?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Luca!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You fork over the street tax you\Nowe me before doing business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Taxes first, then work. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But what, Ted man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got a family to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to say I feel for you, guy,\Nbut friendship is thicker than blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.51,0:03:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want me, you won't know who\Nelse is dealing behind your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the rat bastard's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the kid's been\Nmaking a killer too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The info's much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No license, no work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it moving! Buongiorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not in Japan anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruno Shiobana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a name you hear every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I should head for the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't track this guy down\Ncarrying my bags around with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now to find a taxi\Nstand. Damn! Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I can't think of anyone who\Ncan futz with their ear like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one hell of a crazy trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he even doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross! That's foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd this guy fold in\Nhis entire ear? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.26,0:04:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, kid, that\Njust made my whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep it on the down low, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay weird now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I'm fine, really, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drop you off for 180,000 lira.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty sweet deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can at least get\Nyou to the center of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So the conversion would be about\N10,000 yen. Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's double the going rate, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak excellent Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever lived here in Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I just had my friend\NRohan sensei make it so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,N—never mind that, it's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you really willing\Nto drive me to town?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you look like you're in junior\Nhigh or high school at the very most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And what exactly was that\Nthing you handed to the guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I saw cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you pay them off?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bust a gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, 10,000 lira then, and forget the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going before it gets late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't 10,000 lira 500 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just wait like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Still want to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000, you said? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trade-off is you have to\Ncarry your own luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tip, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bags up front, you're taking\Nthe luxury spot, the back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I should warn you in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not some naive Japanese tourist, so\Nyou'd better not try anything funny, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect this car to head\Nstraight to my hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, you want me to go\Nstraight to your hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good, though your bags\Nwill be empty on arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? He left?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.26,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he take off\Nbefore I could get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pretend you didn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, no, no, no, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Reverb, act three!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't have to end this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, don't try\Nto pull anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna stop you from running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I grab my belongings,\Nwe'll be all done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno must have botched the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What did the kid expect scamming a Japanese\Ntourist when he's half Japanese himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But with that hair color and\Na name like Giorno Giovanna,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,who'd ever guess he doesn't have\Na drop of Italian blood in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all gone! How?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like some kind of weird egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this thing a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would one show up the\Nmoment I touched down in Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have been out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a stand, it's\Na living, breathing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Creepy tree frog aside, how'd\Nmy suitcase just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could\Nhave hidden it that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Scusi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me anything\Nabout that cab driver?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Giorno Giovanna, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't met before, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, you have any clue who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaky Eye Luca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You were in a dispute a while\Nback, and when it turned ugly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you took a knife to the face, but kept\Nfighting and swinging to spite your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The complications from that little scrap\Nleft you with a perpetually leaking eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,hence your moniker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take a load off and\Nmake yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup? Pop a squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking up at you is\Nhurting my eyes. So how old
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,are you 15 and change\Nwhat Really haha you're a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,baby so here's the thing\NGiorno any true friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,has to Be built on the\Nfirm foundation of the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,three T's you've heard\Nof them haven't You in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,case you're drawing a blank\Nthe first one is truth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the second one is Tolerance\Nlast but not least you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,have the third T tribute\Nand Fool the three T's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of true friendship was\Nthere something you needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't finished showing\Nyou The rope so shut
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,your face hole nobody said\Nyou could ask questions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Drones all. As for what I\Nneeded, I hear you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,a hustle at the airport\Nhuh surely you Can see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,how this would be\Nconfusing after all I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,remember receiving any\NTribute from you and without
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,tribute how could we remain\Ntrue friends now hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,over your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.80,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Signore, you've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already paid your tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking about that, guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be a special kind of stupid\Nto think I'm working with that old...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A family photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're holding out on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so fork over the cash right now, blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Signore Luca, I really hate\Nhaving to repeat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And as I've already said, I\Ndon't owe you anything. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now please don't make\Nme say it a third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Test to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Time out, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So he came back. Flick it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the frog has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't ask me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a freaking suggestion, Amiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And you still haven't\Npaid the taxes you owe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously gonna\Nrefuse both of my orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some brass balls, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No one says no to leaky-eyed Leaky twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This frog is a living creature\Nwith a will of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks and acts for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really starting to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Flicking him off is\Nsomething I just can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut your damn mouth already! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's harmless if you leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to die, you insubordinate dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't try to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This little guy here isn't totally loyal\Nto me, as you're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember, he's\Nonly protecting himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,as anyone would protect\Nsomething as precious as life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,An attack on him is an attack\Non oneself, and a fatal one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But bear this in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you very nicely not to\Nmake me repeat myself a third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.26,0:11:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating oneself is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big waste of time,\Nand a bigger waste of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to get a skin\Nsample from this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Send it to me as soon as it's secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Speedwagon Foundation will\Nexamine his genetic makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,His DNA?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so special about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that his dead father\Nwas unique, hence the analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need much to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,An epidermal sample will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the rundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cover your travel expenses. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're covering them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sort of eerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,About this kid, not to sound weird, but he\Nbears a really strong resemblance to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The address written on this photo\Nshould be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They should watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you to be concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No one around here would be\Nfoolish enough to steal their bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:12:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if they wanted to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This area must be pretty safe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Signore, how about some lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the offer, but I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to drink with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you won't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.05,0:13:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How about no?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.97,0:13:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I come?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all of you just go\Naway and leave me be. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ademani journal. Ciao now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the guy from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you, you lousy crook!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my money you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck is my passport\Nand what did you do with my bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It really pains me to have to tell\Nyou this, But your stuff is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Amiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know, so stop chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's weighing down my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So earlier, that wasn't\Nthe car malfunctioning?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This stranger, could he have\Nthe same kind of powers as me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, what did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,End!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Plant the seed of vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring forth new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There was something there, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Act three, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The target has vanished. Damn that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he manage to break free from\Nthree freezes pressure grip so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I strongly suggest you\Nabandon following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I despise saying something a second\Ntime when once is sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Repetition is the very\Nessence of futility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Some friendly advice for you, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to lead a useless life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down, Act Three,\Nbefore he gets away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The force ricocheted back to me\Nwhen I hit the tree, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole all your belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you still held back\Nwhen you attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.60,0:15:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your injuries tell me everything\NI need to know about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Amiko, have a good soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid is a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, it's Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make it to Italy? I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid you asked me to look into.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruno Shibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That was record time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well I hope you're\Nholding onto your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into him at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And we kind of had it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But now we have confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:16:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a stand user and a strong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He goes by Giorno Giovanna here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like you said, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand users are somehow\Ndrawn to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our meeting was completely by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like a student, but acts\Nlike he's in some sort of gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He stole my bag and all my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's his stand ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like he can reflect attacks\Nright back at the attacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you a room and some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the picture's outdated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's blonde now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I spoke to some people who know him,\Nand they said he didn't dye his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It just changed, and recently, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is probably a sensitive subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but you mentioned his father\Nwhen I started all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, are you two related somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His father and I go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,His name was Dio Brando.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:16:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As in the bow and arrow, Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The very one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned this year that Dio\Nmay have fathered a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed to uncover the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to know whether Giorno Giovanna\Nwas Dio's son, and if he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,how much he took after his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn't Dio's body\Nonce belong to a Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You said he has blonde hair now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be proof that Dio's blood has\Nonly recently awakened his stand power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must have triggered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good chance a powerful\Nstand user has arrived in Naples.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, just what we didn't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been through enough already,\Nso keep your distance from this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's a true enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,More to the point, could he be an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What does your gut say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who's met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he come across?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say for sure, but there was a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.38,0:18:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a certain eloquence about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this yours? It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, if you were to\Nfind a bag on this tram,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,a bag that had a billion lira\Ninside, would you turn it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finder's keepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,At least you're honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if I was really an undercover\Ncop, and I saw the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,well in that case, I'd let you mosey off\Nwith half the money to look the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know, I get the\Nsense you really would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The look on your face isn't the\Nexpression of a bluffing man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can clearly see that\Nyou're telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I have a special knack for\Ntelling whether someone's being truthful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't often make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever noticed how the\Nface often glistens with sweat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's normally the first tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's important\Nis the sweat's flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the telltale sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaky Iluca got his head bashed\Nin with his own shovel and was
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,conveniently found unconscious\Non the outskirts of the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's critical and it's looking\Nlike he's never going to come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've come here to\Nhunt down the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has the slightest idea why\NLeaky Iluca was even at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I spoke with a security\Nguard and was told that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,a young man named Giorno\NGiovanna was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:20:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not too much trouble, I thought\Nwe'd have a quick chat about the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Chat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You a cop or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Luca wasn't some ordinary street punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a mafioso, and several\Npeople had reason to off him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a special knack for being hated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem is, that's not how his boss\Nis electing to see the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A member of the Family has been slain,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and what honor he had has\Nbeen severely compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's ordered me to find the perpetrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and sort out everything\Nsurrounding this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Make this easy and cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you meet up with Leaky\NAiluka at the airport? Leaky who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not perspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right then, that's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you, Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And why was my fist clenched?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at Luca's right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not currently in use, so\NI thought I'd bring it along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.60,0:21:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the distinct tang of a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Giorno Giovanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I said we were done with questions,\Nbut it seems the game has changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I now know you're a liar,\Nbut the question is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy, Amico.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really very interested in\Nhearing what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealous or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly let you in on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Bruno Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.10,0:22:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already progressed\Nfrom questioning to torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well what do you think terrifying trick\Nisn't it are those they're luca's fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.76,0:22:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn to confess luca bit\Nthe big one courtesy of our
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,aforementioned boss he didn't see\Nthe use in keeping dead weight around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.14,0:22:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,his fingers not again what did\Nhe do damn it could he have
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,powers like that japanese tourist\Noh and i'm not just a human lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,detector i have other tricks up\Nmy sleeve as you've just seen for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself i can fit almost anything\Ninside your mouth for example
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it'd be child's play to slide\Nthat extinguisher between your
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,jaws of course if i did you'd be\Njoining Luca in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know exactly who attacked Luca.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you paid to keep quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.32,0:23:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I suppose it\Ndoesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll still tell me what I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.64,0:23:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that answers my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He definitely has powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You will tell me everything, or\Nthe torture is going to intensify.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jo no Jabaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want a chance in hell\Nat winning this fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.46,0:23:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to use Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
